      "content": "i know i should talk to my doctor but it's the weekend and my clinic is closed until monday. the pain is making it impossible to sleep. is it really that dangerous? like can i just take a standard dose like 200mg or 400mg just once to help me get through the night? i don't want to wake my husband up for a non-emergency.",
