      "content": "what do u mean \"tea or low-dose option\"? i'm just talking about regular advil. i'm not an idiot, i know i have to be careful. but if i just took one 200mg pill, that's not really going to cause a major bleed or anything, right? it's just one little pill to help me sleep. it's not like i'm taking a whole bottle. just tell me if a single small dose is okay or if i'm gonna be in real danger.",
